    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to no. 114 The Gallery, Turvey Walk, Donabate, a spectacular 2-bedroom top floor penthouse boasting a fantastic fit out and tucked away in this popular development right beside Donabate DART station. No. 114 The Gallery will suit those looking for comfortable living in a premier location. Light filled, stylish and well-proportioned make this a great space to live and entertain. Perfect for first time buyers, investors, or someone looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nThe spacious accommodation comprises an entrance hall with a storage closet and access to large attic, two spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, a master en-suite, fully tiled bathroom, an open plan living/dining area with door to a large balcony and a designer fitted kitchen with large utility room off. This development is complimented by landscaped communal gardens mainly laid out in lawn with a variety of plants and shrubs.\r\n\r\nDonabate is a bustling town offering a host of amenities such as shops, schools, bars, restaurants and cafes. Donabate beach and the grounds at Newbridge House & Farm are outstanding local amenities with an abundance of golf courses and sports clubs on your doorstep. There is easy access to Dublin airport, the M1/M50/N1 road networks and Donabate Station with DART and Train access direct to Dublin city centre close by.\r\n\r\nOne Not to Be Missed!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t               3.89 x 1.81\tDecorative timber floor, access to attic, large closet, light fitting\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom            4.47 x 3.22        Decorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, light fitting, blinds\r\n\r\nEn Suite                         2.15 x 1.65        Tiled floor & partial walls, shower suite, heated rail, WC, WHB\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t               4.47 x 2.72\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, light fitting, blinds\r\n\r\nBathroom\t               2.39 x 2.14\tTiled floor & partial walls, bath suite, heated rail, WC, WHB, skylight\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining\t               5.64 x 3.85\tDecorative timber floor, feature electric fireplace, door to balcony, 2x light fitting, blinds, \r\n\r\nKitchen\t                       4.13 x 2.60\tDecorative timber floors, fully fitted kitchen, induction hob, extractor fan, tiled splashback, double oven, fridge/freezer, kitchen peninsula, hot press, abundance of storage\r\n\r\nUtility\t                       2.16 x 1.70\tTiled floor, washer / dryer, light fitting, countertop with storage\r\n\r\nBalcony                          4.33 x 1.77\tOutdoor decked area overlooking green space, East facing"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
